sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Interface: Stops details
    participant SC as Stops Controller
    participant ST as SQL table: stops
    participant CA as SQL table: causes

    Admin->>UI: Select a day from summary table
    UI->>UI: Store selected day and reset detail page
    UI->>SC: Request stop events for day/team
    SC->>ST: Read paginated stop events
    SC->>CA: Join cause name and TRS flag
    ST-->>SC: Stop event rows
    CA-->>SC: Cause information
    SC-->>UI: Detailed stop list and total count
    UI-->>Admin: Display stop details table

    alt No selected day, no stops or request error
        UI-->>Admin: Show placeholder, empty state or error message
    end
